    known: ['Sicily is a supply base as much as a symbolic possession.', 'Italy contains multiple political centers rather than one decisive capital.', 'The farther the army advances, the more garrisons divide it.'],
    caption: 'The Italian campaign is a chain of ports, roads, cities, and political bargains.',
